{"id": "68880", "title": "四大名捕大结局", "author": "陈嘉上", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 6, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "连载中", "source": "files/article/info/68/68880.htm", "intro": "四大名捕虽救出众人，但各人中毒太深；正我清醒过来要四人救驾。铁手私下觅芝研报仇遭无情阻止，更命芷研回蔡京处取解药救众人；冷血与追命则请无戏带兵营救徽宗。", "base": "files/article/html/68/68880", "chapters": [{"title": "1", "file": "10550389.html", "available": false}, {"title": "2", "file": "10550390.html", "available": false}, {"title": "3", "file": "10554728.html", "available": false}, {"title": "4", "file": "10554729.html", "available": false}, {"title": "5", "file": "10554730.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6", "file": "10558117.html", "available": false}]}